window.products.push({"id":980020,"name":"The Pet Collective Cat Face Cat Meme Party Game - Card Game for Cat Lover and Crazy Cat People - Fun Party Pack for Up to 8 Players - Hilarious Family","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DNx-2wAiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CREATE YOUR OWN CAT MEMES - Cat Face is a cat meme party game brought to you by the crazy cat people at The Pet Collective. An internet cat game that you don't play on the internet. Featuring cats from some of your favorite viral videos, players compete to find the funniest combination of cat faces and funny captions (no litter box required). THE PURR-FECT GIFT FOR CAT LOVERS - Grab one for yourself and gift another to a friend. Cat Face is the purr-fect gift for the cat lover in your life. Hilarious, ridiculous and random, the Cat Face Original Edition is fun for all. It can also be used as cat party decorations and great cat birthday party supplies. FAMILY-FRIENDLY CARD GAME - Are your kittens...um, kiddos...bored or mewing for a new game to play? Spend a great time with your friends and family. Simply get 5 cards and choose one to caption a silly internet cat. Compete for the funniest meme. We'll also include a booklet with 4 variations on the rules to take your game to the next level. Ages 13+ NOT A CAT LOVER? - You hate cats? What's the matter with you? OK, even if you hate cats, you'll have fun making fun of cats when you play Cat Face. Match hilarious cat images with outrageous phrases to create the best combinations. The more rounds you win, the more fun it becomes! SPICE UP GAME NIGHT - We can't promise you the hours of blissful \"me time\" that reading a good book does. But, we can promise that with Cat Face's 300 cards, between 3-8 players won't stop purring for 30-90 minutes. It will take game nights, family dinners and roommate challenges to a whole new level!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DNx-2wAiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Pet Collective","source_asin":"B0B3PW7GVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3PW7GVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3PW7GVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
