window.products.push({"id":980051,"name":"Novelty Lights 36\" LED Palm Tree Rope Light Motif Sculpture, Tropical Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VuSiVZkyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Creat a tropical diaplay in any climate with Novelty Lights Palm Tree LED Rope Light sculptures, available in 2 sizes. Made with brilliant green and warm white LED rope light, you can rest assured these tropical palm trees will shine bright! Constructed with UV-protected crystal clear PVC tubing and vertical LED lamps spaced every 1\" apart, these motifs are attached to a powder-coated aluminum frame that won't rust or fade. Utilizing LED technology in our motifs means they burn cooler, use less energy, and are more durable and brighter when compared to motifs using incandescent bulbs. Each cross motif comes fully assembled with a 5' Power Cord and hanging ring, perfect for home, restrurant, patio, window and special event lighting. 3 season warranty. For indoor/outdoor use. 36\" Palm Tree LED Rope Light Motif Vibrant green and warm white LED rope light 3 Season Warranty  Bright LEDs spaced 1\" apart Small 36\"x 30\" Includes 5' Power Cord & Hanging Ring Durable Frame Won't Chip or Fade UV treated rope light Energy Efficient Fully Assembled For Indoor/Outdoor Use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VuSiVZkyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novelty Lights","source_asin":"B07PPB3ZS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PPB3ZS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PPB3ZS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":980052,"name":"TGT CHEERS Cocktail Shaker Set with Stylish Bamboo Stand 11-pcs | Home Mixology Bartender Kit Gift Box | Cocktail Making Barware tool Set Mixer 25 oz ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615uwiNtzsL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"It's Party Time! Host your parties with this #1 favorite . This elegantly designed Eco-friendly Bamboo cocktail set has all the tools you need to make impressive and delicious sweet & bitter espresso martinis, rich, smooth, and silky old-fashioned, or any drinks that leave everyone tipsy with a good time. This 10-piece Professional All-Inclusive drink mixing kit has been finished to the highest standard and smoothness to ensure durability, no sharp edges, and no leaks when shaking - made of the best high-grade stainless steel alloy ss 304. Rustproof and durable, there are no surprises, all items come as seen in photos and are included in this gift box. We made life easy and already packed this fancy bartender set as a gift - in a classy box for any special occasion such as birthdays, holidays, graduations, housewarmings, and weddings making a special day memorable. The cocktail maker set. All items fit properly in the bamboo stand keeping your place nicely organized with a special touch right on your bar. The mixology bartender kit with stand is dishwasher compatible, unbreakable, and rustproof. It includes: ✓ 25 oz Cocktail Shaker - Including a built-in strainer ✓ Double-sided Jigger with markings - ½ / 1 oz (15/30 ml) ✓ Mojito Muddler ✓ 2x Liquor Pourers ✓ Bar Ice Tongs weight ✓ Mixing Spoon ✓ Hawthorne Strainer ✓ Double Lever Corkscrew ✓ Eco-friendly Bamboo Wooden Stand ✓ Free Ice Ball Maker (When you scan the bar code) ✓ A Cocktail Guide Our name says it, we are The Genuine Tribe - our promise means that you will never have to worry about buying another cocktail set. Know that if there are any problems with our cocktail set, we'll send you another set within the first month. Shake your problems away and get your all-in-one mix","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615uwiNtzsL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TGT CHEERS","source_asin":"B0977FM7TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0977FM7TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0977FM7TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
