window.products.push({"id":980339,"name":"Caramote Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser Touchless 500ml/16oz Smart Sprayer Dispenser Liquid Bathroom Kitchen Toilet Office Hotel Battery Operated Ele","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lgfheiU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Energy saving and environmental protection] A new energy-saving method and innovative bubble pump technology can convert liquid into mist, reducing consumption by 85 percent . Miniature high-performance motor, low power consumption, quiet.Note:in order to avoid waste, Automatic hand washing machines spray a small amount of liquid each time The automatic soap dispenser has a capacity of 500ml and can be used for three households for at least 5 months (3 times a day). Therefore, there is no need to refill the dispenser frequently. In addition, this soap dispenser allows you to see soap from the visible window, so you know when to refill the soap. Wash your hands every day and enjoy a healthy and healthy life(No batteries included) [IPX7 waterproof function]-more waterproof than the usual soap dispenser, our soap dispenser is mainly made of ABS, unique transparent cabinet design, you can check the remaining amount of soap at any time. (Powered by 4 1.5V AA batteries (excluding batteries) [Wide range of applications] Simple design makes this soap dispenser can be placed in any position, put your bathroom in the kitchen sink, bathroom, hotel. Can also be combined with hand sanitizer, shower gel, dishwashing liquid, etc. Suitable for different types of liquids:Users can mix different types of soap with water, such as makeup remover, dishwashing liquid, shower gel, hand soap, detergent, etc. Remember to dilute the hand sanitizer dispenser in the ratio of 1:4 hand sanitizer and water, and then pour it into the container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lgfheiU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caramote","source_asin":"B08R1PG8QS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R1PG8QS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R1PG8QS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
