window.products.push({"id":980494,"name":"Hanging Chalkboard board Organizer with Cubbies (Blue/Cream)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ry-p6T6EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Constructed from durable wood and detailed with a distressed finish, the Hanging Pin Board Organizer with Cubbies adds a touch of vintage inspired style to any room. A beautiful combination of form and function, this organizer features four display areas backed with fabric, open cubbies, and two pull out drawers with small round handles that can be used as a catchall for keys, coins, cell phones, sunglasses, or other small items. The four section organizer allows you to display memos, hang family photos, keep track of shopping lists and to-do lists, or leave important appointment reminders for yourself or your family. The two small front drawers and open cubby areas provide convenient storage for all sorts of little things and serve as the perfect place to stash mittens, gardening gloves, dog leashes, or spare sets of keys. The 13.3ï¾” x 18ï¾” design provides a distinctive touch of style to any home and can be easily hung on the wall in any entry way. Distinctive carved details around the display areas balance the smooth, straight cuts of the drawers and top ledge, making this organizer look like a found treasure. This hanging organizer is available in different colored finishes that evoke different moods for use in any home. The dark natural wood organizer, detailed with blue and white striped fabric, is the perfect addition to your beach house or nautical themed mud room. The heavily distressed green painted wood option, accented with white drawers and feminine French dragonfly and bumblebee prints, can be placed perfectly near your back door or the sun room just off your garden. The distressed cream colored wood organizer features contrasting pale blue drawers that make it the perfect accent to your shabby chic living room or reading room. No matter what color suits your personal sense of style, this organizer adds a touch of rustic charm to any indoor space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ry-p6T6EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Office Collection","source_asin":"B00JEFD4LE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JEFD4LE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JEFD4LE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
