window.products.push({"id":980622,"name":"Dozydotes Child Rocker Recliner Contemporary Pecan Brown Leather DZD11531","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":166.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517P3v-GMmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Contemporary Pecan Brown Leather Like Child Rocker Recliner Chair will make a statement in any living room. This recliner is perfectly suited for the perfect child. Our high-quality recliner comes in kid-durable, soft Leather-like Vinyl which makes cleaning up crumbled cookie crumbs a snap. Bring home comfort and warmth with this Pecan Brown Rocker Recliner. Expect someone to sit back in comfort and style. Add a little rock to your little one's favorite afternoon show. Exclusive safety design keeps rocker from rocking or tipping over while in the reclined position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517P3v-GMmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dozydotes","source_asin":"B00TTCAXP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TTCAXP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TTCAXP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
