window.products.push({"id":980676,"name":"Historic Charleston King Charles Matelasse King Coverlet, Powder Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IRnQw75EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steeped in Historic Charleston's rich, classic style and decorative arts culture, the King Charles 100-Percent cotton matelasse bedding collection offers the ultimate blend of European, Caribbean, and Asian influences. King Charles matelasse bedding offers a luxuriously soft bedspread, coverlet, bedskirt, shams and decorative accent pillows featuring classic 19th century motifs representing the sun, a topiary, a pheasant, and a pineapple. The superior design of King Charles matelasse can be traced back to England circa 1820, incorporating key influences from that time period including the fine arts and quality craftsmanship. Each individual piece is constructed on a special weaving loom to create the luxurious design that defines this lovely classic matelasse collection. Highs and lows created during the jacquard weaving process allow the motifs and sourrounding designs to come to life. Intricate details including rolling arches, half moons, double diamonds and scrolling vines come together to create this beautiful collection. Coverlet and bedspread drape beautifully over the bed to reveal rounded corners. Pair the bedspread with bedskirt to create a complete look. Add coordinating, decorative shams and pillows to create the ultimate bedroom oasis. The heavy-weight, stonewashed matelasse of King Charles bedding ensures life-long durability and style for generations to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91IRnQw75EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Historic Charleston","source_asin":"B00537IH3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00537IH3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00537IH3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
