window.products.push({"id":980777,"name":"Matte Black Metal Electric Toothbrush Holder for Bathroom, Wall Mounted with No Trace Adhesive, Bottom Slot for Charger and Drainage,Bathroom Space Sa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LA3TtTT7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SLOT FOR CHARGER AND DRAINAGE :At the bottom of this holder we designed a slot (Dia. 11mm) to accommodate some charger base and charging cord, it is also a great help with water dripping to keep your electric toothbrush dry and clean. EASY INSTALL EASY REMOVE : The box comes with 2 holders plus 3 adhesive pads (one for spare). It is a kind of strong adhesive, install in 30 seconds on tile, mirror, glass, marble, wood, then start using it ( do not have to wait 48 hours like regular glue). It can be clearly removed without residue. see our video how to remove it correctly. EASY PICK UP EASY PUT DOWN:Unlike most plastic toothbrush holders which \"clamping\" the toothbrush, we think the best way is to give electric toothbrush more space and have it stand onto the holder, easier to pick it up and to put it back, also avoid scratches. MINIMALIST DESIGN : The holder is made with one piece solid metal, matt black painting, Minimalist style, great match with your wall or furnitures. Easy clean, No rust, No sharp edge on anywhere. MORE THAN A TOOTHBRUSH HOLDER : It can be used for regualr single toothbrush holder or toothpaste holder, razer holder stand for shower, electric shaver hanger, it can be a good bathroom accessories orgnizer for more items. Thanks to its metal character You can slightly bend the ear to for fit different brand like philips sonic, Oral B, adult size and kids size..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LA3TtTT7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIVOODS","source_asin":"B0C2CW9SDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CW9SDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CW9SDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
