window.products.push({"id":980864,"name":"French Home Set of 4, 10-ounce Mocha Birch Tumbler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LZI5q2Z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Charming and colorful gold and brown tumblers add beauty and creativity to your table while impressing your family and guests. These glasses are sturdy and durable, great for indoor and outdoor use. French Home's glassware is handmade out of recycled glass in Spain and is an example of European creativity that can be used every day and for special occasions. The organic design is inspired by nature and enhances any decor.Type: Juice GlassMaterial: GlassSet Size: Set of 4Care Instruction: Hand WashColor: Gold, BrownDimensions: 5 inches high x 3 inches wide x 3 inches long","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LZI5q2Z5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"French Home","source_asin":"B0166DZPEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0166DZPEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0166DZPEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":980865,"name":"5.4 oz Coffee Mugs by Bezzera & Balena, Two Double Walled Insulated Shot Glass Espresso Cups, Glass Mug With Engraved Venetian Handle For Cappuccino, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KskTNbn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspiration: House of Balena Born in Manhattan and inspired by the indigenous artisanal coffee and glass culture of Murano, Italy; Bezzera Manhatta is a premium glassware brand with lifetime quality warranty. We use borosilicate glass that is heat resistant and more durable than the industry average. Our core goal is to contribute toward a healthier future with cleaner water, fewer famines and stronger communities. Made to Last: Twice as Thick and DurableWe’ve noticed the top complaint about the glassware category is the current products in the market seem too thin, fragile and almost plastic like. Our goal is to minimize the possibility of shattered glass. So we’ve re-engineered our product to be almost twice as thick as the industry standard.Functionality: Dishwasher Safe Mug Many double wall products require hand wash. Our product will not have that problem. In addition, we utilize our proprietary air seal technology that allows the product to breathe and prevent it from sweating on the outer layer this makes our product microwave and oven safe up to 350°F/180° C.Utility: Your Health, Our PriorityWe refuse to use any logo that contains heavy industrial lead. Instead, we designed each pattern in-house and hand engraved them onto our handles to add friction and ensure that your mug is healthy, slippery proof and artistic.Quality: Limited Lifetime WarrantyWe fully understand that no customer wants to go through the hassle of complaining or returning malfunctioning products, but the least we can do is to provide a lifetime warranty for all our products.Community: Making The World a Better Place5 % of our profit goes toward a charity of your choice. Together, we can help to make this world a better place one small step at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KskTNbn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bezzera Manhatta","source_asin":"B07TZB2H65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZB2H65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZB2H65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
