window.products.push({"id":980952,"name":"16 Piece Knife Set, Dishwasher Safe Kitchen Knife Set with Block, German Stainless Steel Chef Knife Set, Knife Sets for both Home and Restaurant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91btFmGVjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. PREMIUM KITCHEN KNIFE SET: Block knife sets includes 8 inch chef's knife, 8 inch bread knife, 8 inch slicing knife, 4.5 inch utility knife, 4 inch paring knife,universal knife block and 10 PCS colorful measuring spoon. 2. SUPER STEEL: Adopted German High-carbon Stainless steel, it promises you the blade won’t rust over time in most of the circumstances and easy to resharpen. The steel is precisely processed with high-tech vacuum heat treatment to reach the hardness HRC56±2 for extraordinary performance and edge retention. Most importantly, the edge won’t chip easily. 3. WELL BALANCED HANDLE: The handle of this knives set is ergonomically designed to hold comfortably in your hand with great balance. It is made of rubber, which showcases the beauty of the natural material and the uniqueness of each handle. Besides,these knifes whose handles are yellow, orange, and red. Easy to differentiate from one another, these knives are ideal for kitchens that need to designate different knives for use with specific types of food. 4. UNIVERSAL KNIFE BLOCK: The round knife holder is made of high-quality resin material, which has a certain thickness and is more durable. The detachable slot has a total of 2 parts and a height of 1.49 inches, which can perfectly separate and protect the kitchen knives itself. 5. WHAT YOU GOT: 8 inch chef knife, 8 inch bread knife, 8 inch slicing knife, 4.5 inch utility knife, 4 inch paring knife, 10 pcs colorful measuring spoon and universal knife block This knife sets for kitchen with block can be considered as the perfect gift for all your friends, family and professional chef.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91btFmGVjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KL KALOO","source_asin":"B0BPCFNMKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-980952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPCFNMKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPCFNMKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
